    # 
    # Current supported locales include: `da`, `de`, `en`, `en-GB`, `es`, `fi`, `fil`, `fr`, `fr-CA`, `hi`, `id`, `it`, `ja`, `ja-HIRA`, `ko`, `ms`, `nb`, `nl`, `pl`, `pt`, `pt-BR`, `ro`, `ru`, `sv`, `tr`, `zh-Hans`, `zh-HK`, `zh-TW`
    FlatLocalesString locale?;
